{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111270","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1311127001:1":{"text":"どうぞおかけください。私の頭で淹れたお茶を一杯召し上がりますか？","source_cn":"客人们，请坐，想要喝一杯茶吗？我可以用我的脑袋为您沏一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C40369A413EDEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311127002:1":{"text":"わ、私はけっこうです。","source_cn":"呃……我就不用了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2DF270F5792DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311127003:1":{"text":"ロンロンは飲みたいです！","source_cn":"好呀，满满想要来一杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE1601C2D70D492","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311127004:1":{"text":"ポットさんは、いつからここで働いているのですか？","source_cn":"茶壶先生，你在这个废墟……呃，庄园中，服务多久了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA80CC8AEA6D0893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311127005:1":{"text":"では、お茶をお注ぎいたしますね。私はこの世に生を受けた時から子爵様にお仕えしておりますよ。もう七十年は経ちますかかねぇ……","source_cn":"这就对了，客人请拿好杯子，小心烫。我从记事起就在为子爵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDBC4951D808B0F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn